extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Okk8603Ll8oQ7kNvwFVLsu2&_nc_oc=Adr-AL6y-nvQmmJr9IONygm0G8tVIoEpgN-dXunGZwXg2zm_o_PcLLZMVrfBsl0mHGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLvoxHeWtAz94uu89D7SRzfgCObFgfZTS_OxsJ9h_au4g&oe=6AA810D6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ju3G6gbRNUcQ7kNvwE-mWgs&_nc_oc=AdqtnF_pvTeQfnhjfavPACCkxozqsffYUGKN1Nav-YSLTspCPCMCgEYJ5uyaiC7Q2-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJC96oo-VB_GsB7CRQJIcWiK5wotugRxnuRER0apY0Tpg&oe=6AA81822"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H_YQ7lsvjj0Q7kNvwHsrgrZ&_nc_oc=AdpjaBDubyZTLQpcAAIvcSbPN2esKB6PXnKYeieqvgAfQRAWfgCLqbd3mj8zYmN64gs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL3riFkAezuwLLcSDCjqEiyRGdlSA-weZCb106tASYHzw&oe=6AA7E7D9"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":